g.metadata:
{
  "schema": "ppt-master.semantic-table.v2",
  "name": "summary-table",
  "x": 60, "y": 160, "width": 904, "height": 424,
  "columns": [{"text": "", "cell_style": "head"}, {"text": "干涉", "cell_style": "head"}, {"text": "衍射", "cell_style": "head"}],
  "rows": [
    [{"text": "现象", "cell_style": "label"}, "两列相干波叠加后,加强区与减弱区相间分布,位置稳定", "波绕过障碍物或孔,偏离直线方向继续传播"],
    [{"text": "条件", "cell_style": "label"}, "两波频率相同、相位差恒定、振动方向相同", "障碍物或孔的尺寸与波长相差不大,或比波长更小"],
    [{"text": "图样", "cell_style": "label"}, "双缝:明暗相间、等间距的条纹", "单缝:中央亮纹最宽最亮,两侧变窄变暗;圆孔:同心圆环"],
    [
      {"text": "本质", "bold": true, "color": "#F6D77A", "align": "ctr", "font_size": 20},
      {"text": "都是波的叠加;都是波特有的现象——能干涉、能衍射,就是波", "col_span": 2, "bold": true, "color": "#F6D77A", "borders": {"right": {"style": "solid", "color": "#F3EFE4", "width": 1.5}}},
      {"merge_continuation": true}
    ]
  ],
  "column_widths": [140, 382, 382],
  "row_heights": [56, 100, 100, 100, 68],
  "header_rows": 1,
  "style": {
    "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 18,
    "header_font_size": 22,
    "header_text": "#F6D77A",
    "band_row": false,
    "border_color": "#F3EFE4",
    "border_width": 1.5
  },
  "defaults": {
    "cell": {"fill": "#1F3D33", "color": "#F3EFE4", "valign": "middle", "padding": 10}
  },
  "cell_styles": {
    "head": {"color": "#F6D77A", "bold": true, "align": "ctr"},
    "label": {"color": "#B9C2B4", "align": "ctr", "font_size": 20}
  }
}
